    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> be any <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;matrix with entries from the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.&nbsp;The maximum number of such matrices, for which the sum of diagonal elements of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>M</mi></math> is seven, is______.",
