    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>e</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>g</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>h</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>i</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>g</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>e</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>h</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>i</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Case-I : Seven <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and two <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>9</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p><p>Case-II:&nbsp;One <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math> and three <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and five <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&#39;</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>